Ccap_0 PCB_GND CIRCUIT 1.2p
Ccap_1 PCB_GND net_177 0.7p
Lind_0 net_177 net_182 2n
Lind_1 PCB_TRACE net_179 2.5n
Rres_0 net_182 CIRCUIT 0.15
Rres_1 net_179 net_177 0.1
.ENDS Memory-IC-Design__package

*** SUBCIRCUIT Top_package FROM CELL Memory-IC-Design:Top_package{sch}
.SUBCKT Top_package ADDR_IN_PCB CLK_PCB CTRL_PCB DIN_PCB DOUT_PCB GND_PCB VDD_PCB C0 C1 C2 Q_r10_c5 QB_r10_c5 Q_r3_c12 QB_r3_c12 Q_r10_c4 QB_r10_c4 Q_r9_c5 QB_r9_c5
XTop_0 net_7 net_36 net_3 net_12 net_17 Top_0_GBL Top_0_GBLB net_22 net_21 C0 C1 C2 Q_r10_c5 QB_r10_c5 Q_r3_c12 QB_r3_c12 Q_r10_c4 QB_r10_c4 Q_r9_c5 QB_r9_c5 Memory-IC-Design__Top
Xpackage_0 net_36 GND_PCB CLK_PCB Memory-IC-Design__package
Xpackage_1 net_3 GND_PCB CTRL_PCB Memory-IC-Design__package
Xpackage_2 net_7 GND_PCB ADDR_IN_PCB Memory-IC-Design__package
Xpackage_3 net_22 GND_PCB GND_PCB Memory-IC-Design__package
Xpackage_4 net_21 GND_PCB VDD_PCB Memory-IC-Design__package
Xpackage_5 net_12 GND_PCB DIN_PCB Memory-IC-Design__package
Xpackage_6 net_17 GND_PCB DOUT_PCB Memory-IC-Design__package
